<title>ITALY: Banco Napoli due diligence complete - BNL.</title>
<headline>Banco Napoli due diligence complete - BNL.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The operation of due diligence undertaken on Banco di Napoli is now complete and has shown that the accounts of the southern Italian bank are in order, said managing director of BNL Davide Croff.</p>
<p>Croff was speaking while attending a conference on the takeover by state-controlled bank BNL and insurance group INA of the Naples-based bank.</p>
<p>&quot;It has been confirmed that the books are clean and it (due diligence) has been done and done well,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>He added that when the merger of Banco di Napoli and BNL is complete, INA will be the leading shareholder in BNL.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
</text>
